    "q-109672": {
      "dom_id": "step-q109672",
      "name": "Question 13",
      "problem": "If ${X}_{1}∼N(2,7)$ and ${X}_{2}∼N(1,4)$ are independent and $Y=2{X}_{1}-3{X}_{2},$ calculate $P(-4.6<Y<3.48).$ Round your final answer to two decimal places.\n\n*Hint: A table of values of $Φ(z)$ for different values of $z$ is given below, where $Φ(z)$ is the cumulative distribution function for the standard normal distribution. *\n\n<table align=\"center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"5\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr> <th width=\"25%\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$z$</th><th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.00\\,$</th><th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.01\\,$</th><th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.02\\,$</th><th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.03\\,$</th><th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.04\\,$</th>\n</tr><tr> <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.2\\,$</th><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.5793\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.5832\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.5871\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.5910\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.5948\\,$ </td></tr>\n<tr> <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.3\\,$</th><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.6179\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.6217\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.6255\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.6293\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.6331\\,$ </td></tr>\n<tr> <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.4\\,$</th><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.6554\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.6591\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.6628\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.6664\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.6700\\,$ </td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</th>\n\n<th width=\"5%\"></th>\n\n<th>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"5\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr> <th width=\"25%\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$z$</th><th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.00\\,$</th><th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.01\\,$</th><th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.02\\,$</th><th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.03\\,$</th>\n</tr><tr> <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,-0.7\\,$</th><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.2420\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.2389\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.2358\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.2327\\,$ </td></tr>\n<tr> <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,-0.6\\,$</th><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.2743\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.2709\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.2676\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.2643\\,$ </td></tr>\n<tr> <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,-0.5\\,$</th><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.3085\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.3050\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.3015\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.2981\\,$ </td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</th>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>",
      "worked_solution": "Recall that if ${X}_{1}$ and ${X}_{2}$ are independent random variables, where ${X}_{1}∼N({\\mu }_{1},{\\sigma }_{1}^{2})$ and ${X}_{2}∼N({\\mu }_{2},{\\sigma }_{2}^{2}),$ and $a$ and $b$ are constants, then \n\n$$\na{X}_{1}+b{X}_{2}∼N(a{\\mu }_{1}+b{\\mu }_{2},{a}^{2}{\\sigma }_{1}^{2}+{b}^{2}{\\sigma }_{2}^{2}).\n$$\n\nSince ${X}_{1}$ and ${X}_{2}$ are independent, the distribution of $Y$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Y=2{X}_{1}-3{X}_{2} & ∼N(2{\\mu }_{1}-3{\\mu }_{2},4{\\sigma }_{1}^{2}+9{\\sigma }_{2}^{2}) \\\\  & ∼N(4-3,28+36) \\\\  & ∼N(1,64).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $Y$ is normally distributed with mean $\\mu =1$ and standard deviation $\\sigma =\\sqrt{64}=8.$ \n\nWe want to find $P(-4.6<Y<3.48).$ Thus, we convert $Y$ to a standard normal random variable by $z$-scoring:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(-4.6<Y<3.48) & =P(\\frac{-4.6-1}{8}<Z<\\frac{3.48-1}{8}) \\\\  & =P(-0.70<Z<0.31) \\\\  & =P(Z<0.31)-P(Z<-0.70) \\\\  & =Φ(0.31)-Φ(-0.70)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the $z$-table, we see that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Φ(0.31) & ≈0.6217 \\\\ Φ(-0.70) & ≈0.2420.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(-4.6<Y<3.48) & ≈Φ(0.31)-Φ(-0.70) \\\\  & ≈0.6217-0.2420 \\\\  & ≈0.3797.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
